# viewer-fit-1024x640 (fix-viewer-size): the viewer page at a 1024 x 640
# window, as math-viz2's is at c6754e7. The reference's grid gives the
# header (16, 16, 992, 64), the sidebar (16, 96, 400, 528) with its
# content clipped at the padding box (client 526) and scrolling (the
# content is 735 tall), and the canvas (432, 96, 576, 528). The port's
# page grew past the window's bottom here before the fix.
size 1024 640
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
shot viewer-fit-1024x640
